Third-party attribution
=======================

This project is a derived work built on top of the following MIT-licensed
open-source projects. Their dictionaries, DOM translation engine, ASAR
codec and main-process patch logic are included under `vendor/` and
`assets/` (merged / rearranged). All credit for those parts belongs to
their authors:

* ruxiayu/antigravity-zh-cn
  https://github.com/ruxiayu/antigravity-zh-cn
  (main dictionary, preload DOM engine, ASAR codec, main-process patches)

* yuexps/Antigravity-Hans
  https://github.com/yuexps/Antigravity-Hans
  (additional dictionary entries for the desktop app and the IDE)

* nkjDSLcvanv/antigravity-codex-theme
  https://github.com/nkjDSLcvanv/antigravity-codex-theme
  (additional dictionary entries covering Antigravity 2.30–2.34)

Modifications made by this project (dictionary merge and extension, dynamic
string rules, untranslated-text collection, installer, repository
re-targeting) are released under the same MIT terms above.

Antigravity and Google are trademarks of Google LLC. This project is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Google.
